{"id": "e125", "source": "w1", "locator": "§(머리말)", "quote": "To be clear, subagents still have their place, including at the research frontier. Use them when:", "why": "research frontier 에서도 subagent 는 자리가 있다"}
{"id": "e126", "source": "w1", "locator": "§MCP tools", "quote": "Tools are the right fit when the agent needs to take an action, read live data from a system, or return a result in a fixed shape. You can also use tools as a way to keep calling subagents while you migrate.", "why": "tool 이 맞는 경우"}
{"id": "e127", "source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge bases", "quote": "Knowledge bases are the right fit for reference material the agent only needs some of the time.", "why": "knowledge base 가 맞는 경우"}
{"id": "e128", "source": "w1", "locator": "§MCP tools", "quote": "For example, if Y needs X's output, Y's tool checks for it and returns an instruction the model can act on.", "why": "선행 조건은 tool 이 확인"}
{"id": "e129", "source": "w1", "locator": "§Skills", "quote": "/skill-doctor allows you to see what each skill in your library costs and how often it’s actually used, and delete dead weight.", "why": "skill-doctor"}
{"id": "e130", "source": "w1", "locator": "§How to fold subagents into the main agent loop", "quote": "This single loop design also helps with the end state many teams are working toward (an agent that understands a user's high-level goals and acts on their behalf), since it keeps everything the agent has learned in one context.", "why": "원문이 그리는 최종 상태"}
{"id": "e131", "source": "w7", "locator": "§Then: Give Claude rules / Now: Let Claude use judgement", "quote": "When we first rolled out Claude Code, we needed to be sure that Claude avoided worst case scenarios, such as deleting files. This meant we would give particularly strong guidance that might not always be true.", "why": "예전에는 강한 규칙을 prompt 에 넣었다"}
{"id": "e132", "source": "w1", "locator": "§Task-completion evals", "quote": "Grading the agent's final message against a rubric is a good starting point for tracking answer quality.", "why": "rubric 채점부터"}
